        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Unit 13 — We're trying to save the earth!</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async></script>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #fff;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 548px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 10px 14px 30px 14px;\n    position: relative;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  /* ---------- Header ---------- */\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    padding-bottom: 4px;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #e07a2f;\n  }\n  .dots {\n    color: #4bb3d6;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .dots.left { flex: 0 0 26px; }\n  .dots.mid  { flex: 1 1 auto; text-align: center; }\n  .dots.right{ flex: 0 0 90px; }\n  .header .title {\n    padding: 0 6px;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n  }\n  .header .unit {\n    padding: 0 6px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Section labels ---------- */\n  .row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-top: 14px;\n  }\n  .badge {\n    flex: 0 0 26px;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 19px;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    background: #7dc242;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 19px;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n  }\n  .instr {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Word box (2c) ---------- */\n  .wordbox {\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    margin: 8px 0 0 66px;\n    padding: 7px 10px;\n    width: 380px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n  }\n  .wordbox .cols {\n    display: flex;\n  }\n  .wordbox .c1 { flex: 0 0 42%; }\n  .wordbox .c2 { flex: 0 0 30%; }\n  .wordbox .c3 { flex: 1 1 auto; }\n\n  /* ---------- Pink exercise panel ---------- */\n  .pinkpanel {\n    margin: 12px 0 0 34px;\n    width: 466px;\n    border: 2px solid #f0b8c8;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg,#fdf0f3 0%,#fdf7f4 45%,#f7f9f2 100%);\n    padding: 10px 14px 12px 10px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .pinkpanel ol {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding-left: 22px;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n  }\n  .pinkpanel li { margin-bottom: 2px; }\n\n  .blank {\n    display: inline-block;\n    min-width: 92px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #444;\n    text-align: center;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .ans {\n    font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", \"Segoe Script\", cursive;\n    color: #3a3a3a;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n  }\n  .ansline {\n    display: inline-block;\n    min-width: 92px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #444;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- 2d green panel ---------- */\n  .greenpanel {\n    margin: 8px 0 0 60px;\n    width: 440px;\n    border: 1px solid #b9d47a;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    background: #fbfdf3;\n    padding: 8px 10px 8px 10px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .wordgrid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1.25fr 1.35fr 1.15fr 1.4fr;\n    row-gap: 10px;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n  }\n  .cell { position: relative; }\n  .over {\n    display: block;\n    font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", \"Segoe Script\", cursive;\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n    color: #4a4a4a;\n    line-height: 1;\n    margin-bottom: 1px;\n  }\n  .under {\n    display: block;\n    font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", \"Segoe Script\", cursive;\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n    color: #4a4a4a;\n    line-height: 1;\n    margin-top: 1px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- dashed divider ---------- */\n  .divider {\n    border: 0;\n    border-top: 1px dashed #999;\n    margin: 14px 0 0 0;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- handwritten note near 2e/3a ---------- */\n  .note {\n    font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", \"Segoe Script\", cursive;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #6b3f8c;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    margin: 2px 0 0 150px;\n  }\n  .note2 {\n    font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", \"Segoe Script\", cursive;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #6b3f8c;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    margin: 0 0 0 118px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- 3a body ---------- */\n  .qtext {\n    margin: 12px 0 0 34px;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- table ---------- */\n  table.chart {\n    margin: 10px 0 0 34px;\n    width: 466px;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n  table.chart th,\n  table.chart td {\n    border: 1px solid #6fa8dc;\n    padding: 4px 8px;\n    text-align: left;\n    vertical-align: top;\n  }\n  table.chart th {\n    color: #2b6cb0;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    height: 20px;\n  }\n  table.chart td { height: 42px; }\n\n  /* ---------- page number ---------- */\n  .pagenum {\n    width: 30px;\n    height: 20px;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    background: #7dc242;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 20px;\n    margin: 16px 6px 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #bbb;\n    color: #888;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- Header -->\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <span class=\"dots left\">• •</span>\n    <span class=\"title\">We're trying to save the earth!</span>\n    <span class=\"dots mid\">• • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • •</span>\n    <span class=\"unit\">UNIT 13</span>\n    <span class=\"dots right\">• • • • • • • •</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 2c -->\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"badge\">2c</div>\n    <div class=\"instr\">Fill in the blanks with the correct forms of the phrases in the box.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"wordbox\">\n    <div class=\"cols\">\n      <div class=\"c1\">put to good use</div>\n      <div class=\"c2\">build ... out of</div>\n      <div class=\"c3\">pull down</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cols\">\n      <div class=\"c1\">set up</div>\n      <div class=\"c2\">known for</div>\n      <div class=\"c3\">not only ... but also</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pinkpanel\">\n    <ol>\n      <li>Amy Hayes lives in the UK. Many of the old buildings in her neighborhood\n        were <span class=\"ansline\"><span class=\"ans\">pulled down</span></span>.</li>\n      <li>All the rubbish and old things in Amy's neighborhood were then\n        <br><span class=\"ans\">put to good use</span> when Amy built her house.</li>\n      <li>Amy is very creative. She <span class=\"ansline\"><span class=\"ans\">built</span></span>\n        her front gate <span class=\"ansline\"><span class=\"ans\">out of</span></span>\n        rocks and old glass bottles. She put an old boat on top of her house.</li>\n      <li>Jessica Wong sells her bags in a small shop, but she has also\n        <span class=\"ansline\"><span class=\"ans\">set up</span></span>\n        an online business to sell them.</li>\n      <li>Though Jessica's bags are made from old clothes, her bags are\n        <br><span class=\"ansline\"><span class=\"ans\">known for</span></span> being cute and useful.</li>\n      <li>Wang Tao <span class=\"ansline\"><span class=\"ans\">not only</span></span>\n        makes large pieces of metal art that look like\n        animals or humans, <span class=\"ansline\"><span class=\"ans\">but also</span></span>\n        makes smaller pieces for the home.</li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 2d -->\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"badge\">2d</div>\n    <div class=\"instr\"><u>Underline</u> the words in the passage based on the words below. What are\n      the differences?</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"greenpanel\">\n    <div class=\"wordgrid\">\n      <div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"over\">rethink</span>think</div>\n      <div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"over\">reuse</span>use</div>\n      <div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"over\">unusual</span>usual</div>\n      <div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"over\">recycling</span>recycle</div>\n      <div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"over\">building</span>build</div>\n      <div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"over\">creation/creativity</span>create</div>\n\n      <div class=\"cell\">special<span class=\"under\">especially</span></div>\n      <div class=\"cell\">recent<span class=\"under\">recently</span></div>\n      <div class=\"cell\">environment<span class=\"under\">environmental</span></div>\n      <div class=\"cell\">important<span class=\"under\">importance</span></div>\n      <div class=\"cell\">protect<span class=\"under\">protection</span></div>\n      <div class=\"cell\">inspire<span class=\"under\">inspiration</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 2e -->\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"badge\">2e</div>\n    <div class=\"instr\">Make a list of things that need to be done to save the environment.\n      Which things can be done by common people every day? Which things\n      have to be done by governments and organizations? Discuss these with\n      your group.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note\">need to do sth. 需要做某事</div>\n  <div class=\"note2\">need 后宾 (又 v. need doing/to be done (某事) 需要被做<br>[情态v. + do 间接形]</div>\n\n  <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n  <!-- 3a -->\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"badge\">3a</div>\n    <div class=\"instr\">Think about the environment in your town/city and complete the chart\n      below.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"qtext\">\n    Which parts of the town/city have a nice environment? Why are they nice?<br>\n    Which parts <u>need</u> to be improved? Why?\n  </div>\n\n  <table class=\"chart\">\n    <tr>\n      <th>Good environment</th>\n      <th>Why?</th>\n      <th>Bad environment</th>\n      <th>Why?</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td></td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td></td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"pagenum\">103</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
